"正常软件很少把后台程序放在以「.」开头的隐藏文件夹里。" = "Legitimate software rarely puts background programs in hidden folders whose names start with “.”.";
"临时目录和「共享」目录任何程序都能写入，正常软件不会从这里常驻运行。" = "Any program can write to temporary folders and the Shared folder, so legitimate software doesn't run persistently from there.";
"文件或文件夹名像一串随机字符，广告软件常用这种方式躲避识别。" = "The file or folder name looks like random characters, a trick adware often uses to avoid being recognized.";
"标识以 com.apple. 开头，程序却不在系统目录、也不是 Apple 签名的。" = "Its identifier starts with com.apple., but the program isn't in a system folder and isn't signed by Apple.";
"启动时用 %@ 直接执行一段命令，而不是运行一个应用程序。" = "At launch, it runs a command directly with %@ instead of running an app.";
"描述文件可以更改代理、DNS、证书和浏览器设置。如果是公司或学校安装的，可以忽略；否则建议在系统设置中移除。" = "Profiles can change proxy, DNS, certificate, and browser settings. If your company or school installed it, you can ignore this; otherwise, consider removing it in System Settings.";

